{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Sevenfold oath of YHWH shall there be.</b> He swears that it is indeed as his words, and that he did not lay a hand on it to use it for himself — for if he laid a hand on it and afterward it suffered injury, he is liable for the injuries (Bava Metzi'a 94)." "<b>And its owner shall take.</b> The oath." "<b>And he shall not make restitution.</b> The bailee owes him nothing at all (Bava Kamma 106)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:50.850254502Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}